Execution Location	Kernel Space	UserSpace (Parent Process)	UserSpace (In-Process Trampoline)
Kernel Patch Required?	Yes	No	No
Overhead	Very Low (~1-2%)	High (2x-5x on I/O)	Very Low (~2-3%)
Static Binary Support	Native	Native	Complex (requires JIT trap handling)
